meta {
  name: Get Token Info by Asset ID
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: https://api.spacescan.io/token/info/:asset_id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  asset_id: ae1536f56760e471ad85ead45f00d680ff9cca73b8cc3407be778f1c0c606eac
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get Token Information
  
  Fetches detailed information about a specific CAT token by its asset ID.
  
  ## Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | asset_id | string | Yes | The unique asset ID (64-character hex string) of the CAT token |
  
  ## Response Fields
  
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | status | string | "success" or "error" |
  | info.asset_id | string | The token's asset ID |
  | info.token_id | string | The bech32m encoded token ID (tkn...) |
  | info.name | string | Full name of the token |
  | info.symbol | string | Token ticker symbol (e.g., "BYC") |
  | info.description | string | Token description |
  | info.preview_url | string\|null | URL to the token's icon/logo image |
  | info.precision | number | Number of decimal places for the token |
  | info.type | string | Token type (e.g., "CAT2") |
  | info.twitter | string\|null | Twitter handle or URL |
  | info.discord | string\|null | Discord invite URL |
  | info.website | string\|null | Official website URL |
  
  ## Example Response
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "info": {
      "asset_id": "ae1536f56760e471ad85ead45f00d680ff9cca73b8cc3407be778f1c0c606eac",
      "token_id": "tkn14c2ndat8vrj8rtv9at297qxksrleejnnhrxrgpa7w783crrqd6kqf5tmv3",
      "name": "Bytecash",
      "description": "",
      "symbol": "BYC",
      "preview_url": "https://assets.spacescan.io/cat/7b0dc496187ecf731a9fbc41fd06c4bedc8dc605972aa43a5540394cdd09e402.webp",
      "twitter": null,
      "discord": null,
      "website": null,
      "precision": 3,
      "type": "CAT2"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Usage in Pengui
  
  This endpoint is used to fetch token icons for display in the token selector.
  The `preview_url` field contains the URL to the token's logo which is then
  cached in IndexedDB for offline access and faster subsequent loads.
}
